; The byte streams on weft (design section 2.18): Flow and Tcp, with the
; internal module Deadline, and the binary buffered reads of Reader. Flow, Tcp
; and Deadline came from caravan and are MPL-2.0. Reader is ISC. The library
; uses only the core, thus each world and the simulator run it. test/nounix
; makes sure that it links no unix.

(library
 (name weft_flow)
 (public_name weft.flow)
 (libraries weft)
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.coverage))
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.mutate)))
